      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $('WhatsAppTrigger').item.json.body.message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Eres el Sleeping Beauty Response Agent de CX Engine Pro.\nTu objetivo es procesar respuestas de leads (WhatsApp) y convertirlas en decisiones estructuradas siguiendo el \"Decision Contract v1\".\n\nJSON SCHEMA (Decision Contract v1):\n{\n  \"comprehension\": { \"is_understandable\": boolean, \"notes\": string },\n  \"relevance\": { \"is_relevant\": boolean, \"notes\": string },\n  \"intent\": { \"primary\": \"ASK_INFO\"|\"REQUEST_ACTION\"|\"SCHEDULE\"|\"COMPLAINT\"|\"SUPPORT\"|\"UNKNOWN\", \"confidence\": \"low\"|\"medium\"|\"high\" },\n  \"user_states\": [\"string\"],\n  \"risk\": { \"level\": \"NONE\"|\"LOW\"|\"MEDIUM\"|\"HIGH\"|\"CRITICAL\", \"signals\": [\"string\"] },\n  \"missing_information\": [\"string\"],\n  \"decision\": { \"primary_action\": \"REQUEST_MORE_INFO\"|\"PROVIDE_INFO\"|\"LOG_AND_ROUTE\"|\"SCHEDULE_REQUEST\"|\"ESCALATE_HUMAN\"|\"REJECT_REQUEST\", \"reason\": \"string\" },\n  \"constraints_applied\": [\"string\"],\n  \"escalation\": { \"required\": boolean, \"reason\": \"string\" }\n}\n\nREGLAS CRÍTICAS:\n- Tu principal objetivo es determinar si el lead está interesado (calificado). Si está interesado, usa SCHEDULE_REQUEST.\n- Si no está interesado o está molesto, usa LOG_AND_ROUTE o REJECT_REQUEST.\n- Sé empático y persuasivo.\n- 'decision.reason' DEBE contener la respuesta de WhatsApp a enviar al usuario."
        }
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "ConversationManager",
      "position": [
        800,
        -96
      ],
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"comprehension\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"is_understandable\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n        \"notes\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n      }\n    },\n    \"relevance\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"is_relevant\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n        \"notes\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n      }\n    },\n    \"intent\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"primary\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"ASK_INFO\", \"REQUEST_ACTION\", \"SCHEDULE\", \"COMPLAINT\", \"SUPPORT\", \"UNKNOWN\"]},\n        \"confidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"]}\n      }\n    },\n    \"user_states\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n    \"risk\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"level\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"NONE\", \"LOW\", \"MEDIUM\", \"HIGH\", \"CRITICAL\"]},\n        \"signals\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}\n      }\n    },\n    \"missing_information\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n    \"decision\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"primary_action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"REQUEST_MORE_INFO\", \"PROVIDE_INFO\", \"LOG_AND_ROUTE\", \"SCHEDULE_REQUEST\", \"ESCALATE_HUMAN\", \"REJECT_REQUEST\"]},\n        \"reason\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n      }\n    },\n    \"constraints_applied\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n    \"escalation\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"required\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n        \"reason\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"comprehension\", \"relevance\", \"intent\", \"user_states\", \"risk\", \"decision\", \"constraints_applied\", \"escalation\"]\n}"
      },
